title: MemLink 多智能体协作时序图
---
%% 图示说明：展示一次任务从入口、能力发现到四 Agent、状态记忆、结果引用和指标记录的协作顺序。
%%{init: {"theme":"base","sequence":{"diagramMarginX":30,"actorMargin":34,"messageMargin":24,"noteMargin":8},"themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Microsoft YaHei, Noto Sans CJK SC, sans-serif","fontSize":"15px","lineColor":"#64748B","actorBkg":"#EAF3FF","actorBorder":"#377DFF","signalColor":"#475569","noteBkgColor":"#FFF8E8","noteBorderColor":"#E6A700"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor USER as 用户 / 请求
    participant ENTRY as CLI / API / UI
    participant ORCH as Orchestrator
    participant REG as AgentRegistry
    participant PLAN as Planner
    participant RET as Retriever
    participant EXEC as Executor
    participant REV as Reviewer
    participant DATA as State / Memory
    participant METRIC as Metrics

    USER->>ENTRY: 提交任务 + mode
    ENTRY->>ORCH: TaskCreate
    ORCH->>DATA: 检索共享记忆
    DATA-->>ORCH: retrieved_memory_ids

    opt structured + SemanticState
        ORCH->>DATA: 保存 NumPy 状态
        DATA-->>ORCH: state_id
    end

    ORCH->>REG: 发现四类能力
    REG-->>ORCH: Planner / Retriever / Executor / Reviewer
    ORCH->>PLAN: 原始任务 + 记忆摘要
    PLAN-->>ORCH: TaskPlan
    ORCH->>RET: 完整计划或 plan_ref + state_id
    RET-->>ORCH: EvidenceBundle + memory evidence
    Note right of RET: reused_memory_ids 进入证据链
    ORCH->>EXEC: 完整证据或 evidence_ref
    EXEC-->>ORCH: ExecutionResult
    ORCH->>REV: 执行结果 + evidence_ids
    REV-->>ORCH: ReviewResult
    opt structured
        ORCH->>ORCH: 保存结果对象<br/>生成 plan / evidence / execution / review ref
    end

    opt 审核通过且允许写回
        ORCH->>DATA: 写入成功经验
    end
    ORCH->>METRIC: 消息数 · 字节 · 状态 · 命中 · 耗时
    ORCH-->>ENTRY: TaskResult
    ENTRY-->>USER: 最终结果 + 执行轨迹

    Note over PLAN,REV: text 传完整文本；structured 传 schema、result_ref 与 state_id
